WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
You adults are so stupid. Dad is not here.

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,000
But he is a small boss

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,240
Of course there is something important

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:24,120
What kind of coffee costs thirty yuan a bottle?

5
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,440
There are so many people rushing to buy it

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,300
Thank you, little boss

7
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,780
You can deduct more points than the big boss.

8
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:32,020
How can there be a small boss who has a day off during the working day?

9
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:36,950
We support you in usurping the throne. Stop talking.

10
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:38,110
Five minutes late
